Package: faissRGpuConsumer
Type: Package
Title: Minimal GPU Consumer for the faissR Publication Audit
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Publication", "Audit", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "tkcaccia@gmail.com")
Description: A deliberately small downstream package used only by the faissR
    publication benchmark. It retrieves faissR's registered C-callable GPU
    entry point and launches a CUDA checksum kernel over GPU-resident neighbor
    buffers without materializing the full result on the host.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: Rcpp, faissR
LinkingTo: Rcpp, faissR
SystemRequirements: CUDA
